      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" data-account-id=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" accountid=\"5fca8aeffacfd6007656bf65\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Esmé Cowles</a>, seems related to <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" data-account-id=\"6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" accountid=\"6089a45f9889d5006a6c0384\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Michael Durbin</a>'s comments on: <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2195\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-2195</a></p>",
     "created": "09/Sep/16 2:42 PM",
